 "premises": "Local signed balanced gates and programmed reversible wiring are supplied. Per-edge nonnegative flow constrains the direct undisturbed marginals, dark output cells are sharp, and an occupied single pair input has a calibrated fair split in its surrounding context. Using this echo to infer an earlier equality also needs equality of the returned marginal with the direct/matched-idle read and no dependence of the shared prefix on its later setting.",
